Files: data/js/mermaid.min.js
Copyright: 2014-2022 Knut Sveidqvist
License: MIT and Apache-2.0 and MPL-2.0
Comment: Mermaid 12.1.0, one minified bundle without its sources. The bundle carries its own "Bundled license information"
 block at its end, which names what it holds with a licence header: DOMPurify 3.4.12 (Cure53 and other contributors, Apache-2.0 or
 MPL-2.0), lodash-es 4.18.1 (OpenJS Foundation and other contributors, MIT) with Underscore.js 1.8.3 (Jeremy Ashkenas,
 DocumentCloud and Investigative Reporters and Editors, MIT), cytoscape (MIT) with its embedded Promises/A+ thenable (Ralf S.
 Engelschall, MIT), an event object based on jQuery events (MIT), a Bezier curve function generator (Gaetan Renaudeau, MIT) and a
 Runge-Kutta spring physics function generator adapted from Framer.js (Koen Bok, MIT). The bundle holds other libraries whose licence
 headers the minifier removed; only the block above can be read from the file.

